meta {
  name: Text a 6-digit code to a number for one of the person's mailboxes
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/phone/verify
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "phone": "string",
    "identity": "string"
  }
}

docs {
  The answer is the same for every acceptable number, whether or not it is on Pigeonpost. The
  code is valid for 10 minutes and 5 tries. Resend limits: 1 per 60 s and 5 per 24 h per
  number, 10 per 24 h and 3 pending per account, 20 per 24 h per IP, plus the platform SMS
  budget (docs/contacts-and-phone.md §4).
}
